                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Secretary of State Dulles and Harold E. Stassen, Director of the Mutual Security
                    Administration, visited Western Europe between January 31 and February 8, 1953
                    for a series of conferences and discussions with various American and European
                    officials on outstanding problems facing the Western alliance including the EDC.
                    For documentation on the Dulles–Stassen trip to Europe in January and February
                    1953, see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v05p2/pg_1548">pages 1548</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
